      "openalex_id": "W4213242418",
      "doi": "10.3390/rel13020165",
      "title": "\u201cThe Tragedy of Messianic Politics\u201d: Gustav Landauer\u2019s Hidden Legacy in Franz Rosenzweig and Walter Benjamin",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Libera Pisano",
          "openalex_id": "A5013480667",
