      "openalex_id": "W4381435640",
      "doi": "10.3390/rel14060808",
      "title": "The Profane Land of the Happy: On the Messianic Promise in the Work of Giorgio Agamben",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ype De Boer",
          "openalex_id": "A5013623004",
